<rml>
<head>
    <title>Seam</title>
    <!--
      One document, both legs: RmlUi lays it out natively, ui::uidoc::rmlToHtml rewrites it for the DOM on the web.
      The ring is first, second, field, last — wrapping at both ends (nav-up/nav-down here natively, by document order
      on the web). The range is out of it on both legs, by its INLINE `tab-index: none`: RmlUi gives every form control
      an inline `tab-index: auto` no stylesheet rule can beat, and kama_ui_web.js reads the same inline style.
      So is the checkbox. The list is one binding over rows of a fixed height, so a click lands on a row by arithmetic
      without binding it; its first row's text has an id of its own, its second's does not. `[hidden]` is the
      document's own rule: neither leg hides anything for the attribute alone. The textarea, the select and the radios
      are one of each control kind, for counting changes per edit; they are out of the ring too. The rows drag
      (`draggable="true"`), and the package's two drag classes change their width, which a box shows on both legs.
      The zone (0.4.0) is `droppable="true"` inside a bound box, placed to the right where it moves nothing else and
      covers no centre a click aims at (the heading's is at the stage's middle, above it), in the web page's view: its top
      row has an id of its own, which a drop on it must NOT name, and the class shows on the zone alone. (0.6.0) A
      scrollbar has a width: RmlUi gives a select's box one, and unstyled it spans the box, over the options a click
      aims at.
    -->
    <style>
        body { font-family: LatoLatin; font-size: 20dp; color: #ffffff; width: 100%; height: 100%; }
        div, p, h1, button { display: block; }
        h1 { font-size: 28dp; }
        #panel { padding: 8dp; width: 300dp; background-color: #202838ff; }
        button { width: 200dp; height: 32dp; margin-top: 4dp; background-color: #304060ff; tab-index: auto; nav: auto; focus: auto; }
        button:focus { background-color: #5070a0ff; }
        input { display: block; width: 240dp; height: 28dp; margin-top: 4dp; tab-index: auto; nav: auto; }
        #first { nav-up: #last; }
        #last { nav-down: #first; }
        #meter { width: 100dp; height: 10dp; background-color: #ff8000ff; }
        #meter.wide { width: 300dp; }
        img { display: block; }
        input.range { width: 200dp; height: 16dp; }
        input.range slidertrack { background-color: #404040ff; }
        input.range sliderbar { width: 12dp; background-color: #ffffffff; }
        #list { padding: 6dp; width: 300dp; background-color: #283020ff; }
        #list div, #list p { height: 24dp; }
        #list div.ui-dragging { width: 200dp; }
        #list div.ui-drop-target { width: 250dp; }
        #agree { width: 20dp; height: 20dp; }
        [hidden] { display: none; }
        textarea { display: block; width: 240dp; height: 40dp; margin-top: 4dp; }
        select { display: block; width: 200dp; height: 24dp; margin-top: 4dp; background-color: #304060ff; }
        select selectvalue { display: block; height: 24dp; }
        select selectbox { display: block; background-color: #303030ff; }
        select selectbox option { display: block; height: 20dp; }
        scrollbarvertical { width: 8dp; }
        scrollbarvertical sliderbar { min-height: 10dp; }
        #choices input { width: 20dp; height: 20dp; }
        #zones { position: absolute; left: 360dp; top: 80dp; width: 300dp; background-color: #303828ff; }
        #zone { width: 280dp; height: 48dp; }
        #zone p { height: 24dp; }
        #zone.ui-drop-target { width: 290dp; }
        #zone-a.ui-drop-target { width: 100dp; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <h1 id="title">Seam</h1>
    <div id="panel">
        <button id="first" autofocus>First</button>
        <button id="second">Second</button>
        <input id="field" type="text" value=""/>
        <button id="last">Last</button>
    </div>
    <div id="rows"><p id="row0">zero</p><p id="row1">one</p></div>
    <div id="meter"></div>
    <input id="level" type="range" min="0" max="1" step="0.05" value="0.5" style="tab-index: none;"/>
    <img id="pic" src="/img/dot.pam"/>
    <p id="note">A note</p>
    <div id="list">
        <div id="row-a" draggable="true"><p id="row-a-name">Alpha</p></div>
        <div id="row-b" draggable="true"><p>Beta</p></div>
    </div>
    <input id="agree" type="checkbox" value="yes" style="tab-index: none;"/>
    <textarea id="notes" style="tab-index: none;"></textarea>
    <select id="pick" style="tab-index: none;">
        <option id="pick-a" value="a" selected>A</option>
        <option id="pick-b" value="b">B</option>
    </select>
    <div id="zones">
        <div id="zone" droppable="true"><p id="zone-a">Zone A</p><p>Zone B</p></div>
    </div>
    <div id="choices">
        <input id="choice-a" type="radio" name="choice" value="a" checked style="tab-index: none;"/>
        <input id="choice-b" type="radio" name="choice" value="b" style="tab-index: none;"/>
    </div>
</body>
</rml>
